From bfb50ca9aa06d8a518c4ef954de7762502d03806 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kinoppyd <ppyd@kinoppyd.dev>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 10:15:37 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Add dual-core HID forwarding, LED output and bounded
 observation

---
 .../picoruby-hid-relay/include/hid_relay.h    |   9 +
 .../ports/rp2040/hid_relay.c                  | 194 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../picoruby-machine/ports/rp2040/machine.c   |  15 ++
 .../ports/rp2040/usb_descriptors.c            |  44 +++-
 .../picoruby-usb-hid/ports/rp2040/usb-hid.c   |   3 +
 5 files changed, 256 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)
